{"4805930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Marketfield Idle","steam_appid":4805930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4860280],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Marketfield is a cozy incremental farming game about turning tiny harvests into huge numbers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow crops, sell goods, cook recipes, automate production, and prestige into stronger runs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With 1200+ upgrades, multiple strategy paths, and lots of synergies to discover, each run gives you new ways to grow faster and push further.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEGIN WITH A CLICK<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click farms to produce resources and get your village moving<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4805930\/extras\/7240caff0ecb51fa2078916f67e122e3.poster.avif?t=1793717641\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4805930\/extras\/7240caff0ecb51fa2078916f67e122e3.webm?t=1793717641\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4805930\/extras\/7240caff0ecb51fa2078916f67e122e3.mp4?t=1793717641\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN RESOURCES INTO GOLD<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your gathered resources on the market and grow your economy<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4805930\/extra